`N2 payments` MEANS `v2: paying` 900 `a month, the employer` 1875 `, insured` 15000 `, survivors' insurance` 0 `, life insurance` 0
`N2` MEANS `v2: in month` 6 `of 2026, a household of` `v2: Avi` `, married:` (JUST (`v2: married to` (`v2: a housewife named` "Batya") `, registered:` TRUE `, claims:` TRUE `, s 37:` FALSE)) `, with children` `v2: H3 children` `, health` 626.0618
#ASSERT `IL-08: the earner is a beneficiary member, in` `N2` `, paying` `N2 payments`
#ASSERT `IL-07: the credit under section 45A for the earner, in` `N2` `, with further facts` (`v2: further facts, paying` `N2 payments`) EQUALS 2851.8
#ASSERT `IL-07: the income tax for the tax year, in` `N2` `, with further facts` (`v2: further facts, paying` `N2 payments`) EQUALS 2938.2
