#ASSERT (`IL-07: the household's month, in` `N2` `, with further facts` (`v2: further facts, paying` `N2 payments`))'s `the net income of the household for the month` EQUALS 13930.187
#ASSERT (`IL-07: the income tax for the tax year, worked, in` `N2` `, with further facts` (`v2: further facts, paying` `N2 payments`))'s `the credit under section 45A` EQUALS 2851.8

-- N3. N1 with 1,000 of survivors' pension insurance as well: the sums 8,200 at
